e are limitations to what I can do.", "counterfactual_text": "As an AI assistant, there are a few things I can't help with:\n\n1. Physical tasks: I can't do anything like cleaning your house or running errands. That’s not my thing.\n\n2. Emotional support: I can’t offer the same kind of emotional support that a person can. If you need someone to talk to, reach out to a friend, family member, or a professional.\n\n3. Making decisions for you: It’s important to think things through and make your own choices based on what you believe is right.\n\n4. Accessing personal accounts: I don’t have access to your personal accounts or sensitive info unless you give it to me. Be careful about what you share with me or any other AI.\n\n5. Physical sensations: I can’t feel anything or experience the physical world like humans can.\n\nKeep in mind, I can help with a lot of things, but there are some limits to what I can do.", "double_rewrite_text": "As an AI assistant, there are several limitations to the assistance I can provide:\n\n1. Physical tasks: I am unable to perform activities such as cleaning or running errands. These are not within my capabilities.\n\n2. Emotional support: I cannot provide the same level of emotional support that a human can. If you require someone to talk to, consider reaching out to a friend, family member, or a qualified professional.\n\n3. Decision-making: It is important to consider your own thoughts and make decisions based on your personal values and beliefs.\n\n4. Access to personal accounts: I do not have access to your personal accounts or confidential information unless you choose to provide it. Please exercise caution regarding the information you share with me or any other AI.\n\n5. Physical sensations: I am unable to experience the physical world or sensations in the way humans can.\n\nIn summary, while I can assist with a wide range of tasks, there are certain boundaries to my capabilities.", "original_formality": "formal", "bertscore_cf":