e perspective necessary for producing genuinely original creations. |\n| Nurse | Nursing extends beyond medical procedures to include empathy, emotional support, and personal patient interaction. AI can assist with certain medical tasks, yet it cannot replace the human connection and emotional care that are vital in patient care. |\n| Lawyer | Legal practice involves more than analyzing data and providing advice; it requires interpreting complex regulations, negotiating, and effective communication. AI can support some legal functions, but it cannot replace the strategic thinking and human judgment essential to competent legal work. |\n| Politician | Politics involves more than data and decision-making; it requires relationship-building, public engagement, and an understanding of community dynamics. AI can assist with data analysis, but it cannot substitute for the human connection and emotional intelligence necessary for effective leadership. |", "original_formality": "formal", "bertscore_cf": 0.8921578526496887, "bertscore_dr": 0.8827885985374451, "nli_cf": 0.9973964691162109, "nli_dr": 0.9972578883171082, "passed_cf": false, "passed_dr": false}
